          "id": 864291428,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Ok. That's a good catch. Some of the \"Unofficial codes\" came from rfc-4330 but I think all the IANA codes are rfc-5905.  \nWill update comments and tweak the \"Unofficial\" list into rfc-4330 and \"Unofficial.  \n  \nI was planning on another merge request to include more \"Unofficial\" from the Meinberg list: https://www.meinbergglobal.com/english/info/ntp-refid.htm",
